A widths list writes one col per entry

```
{widths=25,50}
| a | b | c |
.
<table>
  <colgroup>
    <col style="width: 25%;">
    <col style="width: 50%;">
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td><td>b</td><td>c</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
{widths=,50}
| a | b | c |
.
<table>
  <colgroup>
    <col>
    <col style="width: 50%;">
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td><td>b</td><td>c</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
{widths=101}
| a |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
{widths=50,101}
| a | b |
.
<table>
  <colgroup>
    <col style="width: 50%;">
    <col>
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td><td>b</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```
